                                "sense_id": "88bbe21c-cf4f-3240-9c74-ae4ed0c55b01",
                                "text": "Master sent me over with the shay-cart, to carry your luggage up to the house. He’d ha’ sent some saddle-horses, but he thought you’d rather walk, being a cold day."
